      "_disabled": [
        "cpdf for linux-aarch64 is published linked against GLIBC_2.42, which no",
        "current distribution ships -- Ubuntu 24.04 has 2.39 -- so the binary cannot",
        "run and every pipeline fails with a linker error. It is left out rather than",
        "shipped broken. _post_process_pdf() already degrades gracefully without cpdf:",
        "linearisation and squeezing are skipped, everything else works. Re-enable by",
        "renaming this key to \"name\" once upstream links against something older.",
